000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. SRCHALL.
000300 DATA DIVISION.
000400 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000500 01  CLASS-INIT.
000600     05  FILLER PIC X(14) VALUE 'AAssets       '.
000700     05  FILLER PIC X(14) VALUE 'EExpenses     '.
000800     05  FILLER PIC X(14) VALUE 'IIncome       '.
000900     05  FILLER PIC X(14) VALUE 'LLiabilities  '.
001000     05  FILLER PIC X(14) VALUE 'QEquity       '.
001100 01  CLASS-TABLE REDEFINES CLASS-INIT.
